# Ultima destroys every artifact and creature, Bot1's and Bot2's, and ends the turn (CR 701.8a, 724.1). Haywire Mite's
# "when this creature dies" triggers as Ultima destroys it, but that was before the turn began to end, so the ability
# ceases to exist and is never put on the stack (CR 724.1a): Bot2 gains no life. Ultima is exiled, not put into the
# graveyard (724.1b). Lands and the enchantment Dawn of a New Age stay. The end step is skipped (724.1e), so Dawn's "at
# the beginning of your end step" never triggers: it keeps its hope counter and Bot1 draws nothing. Turn 4 is Bot2's.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Black Lotus
Ornithopter
Dawn of a New Age
Ultima
Plains x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Haywire Mite
Mox Sapphire
Mountain x10

